#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:4
msgid "What's New in OpenToonz"
msgstr "What's New in OpenToonz"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:6
msgid ""
"In this section you can find a list of Highlights in the latest release of "
"OpenToonz; these may include New Features, Bug Fixes or Enhancements to "
"already existent features. Here, you can also find links to past versions' "
"Release Notes, to keep track of OpenToonz development history throughout time."
msgstr ""
"在本节中，您可以找到OpenToonz最新版本中的亮点列表；这些可能包括新功能、Bug修复"
"或对现有功能的增强。在这里，您还可以找到过去版本的发行说明的链接，以跟踪"
"OpenToonz的开发历史。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:13
msgid "v1.6"
msgstr "v1.6"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:20
msgid ""
"|new| **Rhubarb integration** for automatic lip-syncing [Tahoma2D port, with "
"modifications]."
msgstr "|新的|**大黄集成**用于自动唇形同步[Tahoma2D端口，经过修改]。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:21
msgid ""
"|new| Xsheet/Timeline: Ability to **Shift + drag** an exposed cell to move it, "
"while automatically adjusting neighbouring hold cells."
msgstr ""
"|new | X表格/时间线：能够**按住Shift键并拖动**暴露的单元格以移动它，同时自动调"
"整相邻的保持单元格。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:22
msgid ""
"|new| Xsheet/Timeline: Restored original Toonz feature for **changing parent "
"of a column from the XSheet header** [Tahoma2D port]."
msgstr ""
"|new | Xsheet/Timeline：恢复了原始的Toanz功能，用于**从Xsheet标题**[Tahoma2D端"
"口]更改列的父级。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:23
msgid ""
"|new| Xsheet/Timeline: **Cell Mark** feature for identifying desired cells "
"using colored dots."
msgstr ""
"|新的|Xsheet/Timeline：**单元格标记**功能，用于使用彩色点识别所需单元格。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:24
msgid "|new| UI: Xsheet **Minimum Layout** for ultra-compact column size."
msgstr "|新|UI:Xsheet**最小布局**，适用于超紧凑的列大小。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:25
msgid "|new| UI: Xsheet **zoom** control."
msgstr "|新|UI:Xsheet**缩放**控件。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:26
msgid "|new| UI: Zoom in/out and fit floating panel geometry commands."
msgstr "|新|UI：放大/缩小和适应浮动面板几何图形命令。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:27
msgid "|new| Color Display: **30bit color display** feature."
msgstr "|新|彩色显示：**30位彩色显示**功能。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:28
msgid "|new| I/O: Export **Xsheet to PDF**."
msgstr "|new | I/O：将**X表格导出为PDF**。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:29
msgid "|new| I/O: Export to **TVPaint JSON** file format."
msgstr "|new | I/O：导出为**TVPaint JSON**文件格式。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:30
msgid "|new| I/O: **OpenEXR** image format support."
msgstr "|新的|I/O：**OpenEXR**图像格式支持。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:31
msgid "|new| I/O: File Path Processing Using Regular Expressions."
msgstr "|new | I/O：使用正则表达式进行文件路径处理。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:32
msgid ""
"|new| Cleanup: Enabled to **Cleanup without Line Processing**, allows applying "
"Autocenter, Rotation, etc. without further processing of the images."
msgstr ""
"|new |清理：启用**无需行处理即可清理**，允许应用自动中心、旋转等，而无需对图像"
"进行进一步处理。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:33
msgid "|new| Rendering: **Multi-Thread FFMPEG** option for faster rendering."
msgstr "|新|渲染：**多线程FFMPEG**选项，可实现更快的渲染。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:34
msgid ""
"|new| Brush and Paint Brush Tools: **Lock Alpha** setting for Toonz Raster and "
"Raster level types."
msgstr "|新|画笔和绘制画笔工具：**锁定Toanz光栅和光栅级别类型的Alpha**设置。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:35
msgid "|new| Style Editor: **Hex editbox** for color values in Style Editor."
msgstr "|新|样式编辑器：**十六进制编辑框**用于样式编辑器中的颜色值。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:36
msgid "|new| Style Editor: Hex color names editor."
msgstr "|new |样式编辑器：十六进制颜色名称编辑器。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:37
msgid ""
"|new| Effects: **Linear color space** option for all Layer Blending Ino "
"effects."
msgstr "|新|效果：**线性颜色空间**选项，用于所有图层混合Ino效果。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:38
msgid "|new| Effects: **Conical Transform** option for Fractal Noise Iwa effect."
msgstr "|新|效果：**用于分形噪波Iwa效果的圆锥变换**选项。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:39
msgid ""
"|new| Effects: **Image Size** option for the Input Size parameter for Tile Iwa "
"effect."
msgstr "|新|效果：**图像大小**选项，用于Tile Iwa效果的输入大小参数。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:40
msgid "|new| Effects: **GPU HSL Blend** shader effect."
msgstr "|新|效果：**GPU HSL混合**着色器效果。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:41
msgid "|new| Effects: **Bokeh Advanced Iwa** effect."
msgstr "|新|效果：**散景高级岩画**效果。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:42
msgid "|new| Effects: **Compass Gadget** for Radial and Spin Blur effects."
msgstr "|新|效果：**指南针小工具**用于径向和旋转模糊效果。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:43
msgid "|new| Camera Capture: **Camera calibration**."
msgstr "|新|相机捕获：**相机校准**。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:44
msgid "|enhancement| Audio: **Improved Audio Recording**."
msgstr "|增强|音频：**改进的录音**。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:45
msgid "|enhancement| Xsheet/Timeline: Enhanced **Note level column**."
msgstr "|增强| X表/时间线：增强**注释级别列**。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:46
msgid "|enhancement| Viewer: Enhanced **Flipbook playback**."
msgstr "|增强|查看器：增强**动画书播放**。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:47
msgid ""
"|enhancement| Schematic: Allowed **Renaming** Pass Through Nodes (Tahoma2D "
"port)."
msgstr "|增强|示意图：允许**重命名**直通节点（Tahoma2D端口）。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:48
msgid "|enhancement| I/O: Enabled to **set Raster level frame number format**."
msgstr "|增强| I/O：已启用**设置光栅级帧数格式**。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:49
msgid "|enhancement| I/O: Enabled to **use PNG for new Raster levels**."
msgstr "|增强| I/O：已启用**将PNG用于新的光栅级别**。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:50
msgid "|enhancement| I/O: Enhanced **FFMPEG GIF export**."
msgstr "|增强| I/O：增强**FFMPEG GIF导出**。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:51
msgid ""
"|enhancement| File Browser: Enabled to **view palette files from the File "
"Browser**."
msgstr "|增强|文件浏览器：已启用**从文件浏览器查看调色板文件**。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:52
msgid ""
"|enhancement| Palette: Enabled to **paste style's color into a color field**."
msgstr "|增强|调色板：允许**将样式的颜色粘贴到颜色字段**中。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:53
msgid ""
"|enhancement| Effects: **Fx Intensity** parameter for controlling global "
"effect intensity."
msgstr "|增强|效果：**Fx强度**参数，用于控制全局效果强度。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:54
msgid "|enhancement| Effects: **Redesigned Pass Through** effect node."
msgstr "|增强|效果：**重新设计的传递**效果节点。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:55
msgid ""
"|enhancement| Camera Capture: Enabled **inputting frame with suffix** in "
"Camera Capture."
msgstr "|增强功能|相机捕获：在相机捕获中启用**输入后缀为**的帧。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:56
msgid "|enhancement| Stop-motion: Enhanced **Stop motion** feature."
msgstr "|增强|停止运动：增强**停止运动**功能。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:57
msgid "|enhancement| Packaging Opentoonz for Fedora distribution."
msgstr "|增强|为Fedora发行版打包Opentoonz。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:58
msgid "|fix| Crash on showing snapshot in flipbook."
msgstr "|修复|在翻页书中显示快照时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:59
msgid "|fix| Crash on saving scene containing missing palette level."
msgstr "|修复|保存包含缺少调色板级别的场景时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:60
msgid "|fix| Crash on undoing tool."
msgstr "|修复|撤消工具时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:61
msgid "|fix| Crash after starting a pen stroke from inactive window."
msgstr "|修复|从非活动窗口开始笔划后崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:62
msgid "|fix| Crash on Stage Schematic Column Right click."
msgstr "|fix |舞台示意图列崩溃右键单击。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:63
msgid "|fix| Crash on rendering ArtContour fx."
msgstr "|修复|渲染ArtContour fx时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:64
msgid "|fix| Crash on rendering PaletteFilter Fx (and other fxs) with hyphen."
msgstr "|修复|使用连字符渲染PaletteFilter Fx（和其他Fx）时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:65
msgid "|fix| Crash on cleaning up zerary column."
msgstr "|修复|清理zerary柱时发生故障。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:66
msgid "|fix| Crash on creating a zerary fx in the camera column."
msgstr "修复|在相机列中创建zerary fx时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:67
msgid "|fix| Crash on creating Macro Fx from the Fx Browser."
msgstr "|修复|从Fx浏览器创建宏Fx时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:68
msgid "|fix| Crash On Inserting Fx."
msgstr "|修复|插入Fx时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:69
msgid "|fix| Crash on clicking shortcut tree."
msgstr "|修复|单击快捷方式树时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:70
msgid "|fix| Crashes when using Type tool."
msgstr "|修复|使用胶带工具时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:71
msgid "|fix| Crash on deleting control point while dragging."
msgstr "|修复|拖动时删除控制点时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:72
msgid "|fix| Crash on switching scenes while selecting raster level frame."
msgstr "|修复|选择光栅级帧时切换场景时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:73
msgid "|fix| Undo Malfunction."
msgstr "|修复|撤消故障。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:74
msgid "|fix| File browser assertion failure."
msgstr "|修复|文件浏览器断言失败。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:75
msgid "|fix| \"Show Folder Contents\" command for UNC path."
msgstr "|修复UNC路径的|“显示文件夹内容”命令。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:76
msgid "|fix| Viewer playback."
msgstr "|修复|查看器播放问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:77
msgid "|fix| Flipbook wobbling when dragging while playing."
msgstr "|修复|播放时拖动动画书时抖动的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:78
msgid "|fix| Pressing Shift key loses focus when renaming cell."
msgstr "|fix |重命名单元格时按Shift键会失去焦点。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:79
msgid "|fix| Autorenumber of Raster Level."
msgstr "|fix |光栅级别的自动枚举。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:80
msgid "|fix| Cell Selection on Click."
msgstr "|修复|单击时的单元格选择。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:81
msgid "|fix| GIF rendering on older versions."
msgstr "|修复|GIF在旧版本上的渲染问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:82
msgid "|fix| Saving TLV."
msgstr "|修复|保存TLV。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:83
msgid "|fix| Output file name for movie format."
msgstr "|fix |电影格式的输出文件名。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:84
msgid "|fix| PSD loading and level format preferences."
msgstr "|修复|PSD加载和级别格式首选项。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:85
msgid "|fix| Backtab key to work for moving styles shortcut scope."
msgstr "|修复了|Backstab键用于移动样式快捷方式范围的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:86
msgid "|fix| FrameIDs Inconsistency in Level Strip Commands."
msgstr "|修复|水平条命令中FrameID不一致的问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:87
msgid "|fix| Memo Popup Background Color."
msgstr "|修复|备忘录弹出窗口背景颜色。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:88
msgid "|fix| FX gadget picking."
msgstr "|修复|FX小工具拾取问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:89
msgid "|fix| Margin of Directional Blur Fx Iwa."
msgstr "|fix |方向模糊边缘Fx Iwa。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:90
msgid "|fix| Zerary Fx bugs."
msgstr "|修复|Zerary Fx错误。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:91
msgid "|fix| Friction parameter behavior of the Particles Fx."
msgstr "|修复|“粒子Fx”的“摩擦”参数行为。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:92
msgid "|fix| Rendering Fx After Xsheet Node."
msgstr "|fix |在Xsheet节点后渲染Fx。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:93
msgid "|fix| Channel clamping behavior in Layer Blending Fxs."
msgstr "|修复|图层混合Fxs中的通道夹紧行为。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:94
msgid "|fix| Fx Gadget Offset."
msgstr "|修复|Fx小工具偏移。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:95
msgid "|fix| Bokeh Fxs Artifacts."
msgstr "|修复|散景Fxs伪影。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:96
msgid "|fix| Schematic node placement fix."
msgstr "|fix |原理图节点放置修复。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:97
msgid "|fix| Shortcut loading from file."
msgstr "|fix |从文件加载快捷方式。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:98
msgid "|fix| Tool options' shortcuts to work without opening tool options bar."
msgstr "|修复|工具选项的快捷方式，无需打开工具选项栏即可工作。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:99
msgid "|fix| Camera capture's level control."
msgstr "|修复|相机捕获的级别控制。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:100
msgid "|fix| Mesh file naming."
msgstr "|修复|网格文件命名问题。"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:101
msgid "|fix| Wheel scrolling on the output settings popup"
msgstr "|修复|输出设置弹出窗口上的滚轮滚动"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:102
msgid "|fix| Missing Checkboxes in Menu Item"
msgstr "|修复|菜单项中缺少复选框的问题"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:103
msgid "|fix| Convert to TLV Palette Saving"
msgstr "|fix |转换为TLV调色板保存"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:104
msgid "|fix| Raster Deformation Slowness"
msgstr "|修复|光栅变形缓慢"

#: ../../source/whats_new.rst:106
msgid "...and much more!"
msgstr "…还有更多！"

